  "title": "05/06/2026 – Precision Optics Schedules Third Quarter of Fiscal Year 2026 Conference Call for May 13, 2026",
  "summary": "LITTLETON, Mass., May 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Optics Corporation, Inc. (Nasdaq: POCI) (the “Company”), a leading designer and manufacturer of advanced optical instruments for the medical and defense/aerospace industries, today announced that it has scheduled a conference call to discuss the Company’s third quarter fiscal year 2026 financial results on Wednesday, May 13, […]",
